                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Good afternoon. I’m trying to get in shape these days, and my friend recommended your facility. I’m interested in signing up for a membership.\\nB: I can help you with that. Here is a list of the different packages we offer. I recommend the Elite Package because it has the most flexibility.\\nA: Hmm... to be honest, I don’t think I would have time to take five classes a week. Twice a week would be enough for me.\\nB: All right. Would you like to pay for the membership now?\\nA: Could I see a bit more of the facility first?\\nB: Of course. I can show you around.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
